    <main class="w-full">
      <div id="content" class="container opacity-0"><section data-section-type="text_and_single_image" data-section-id="pg086_sec001" class="w-full bg-white"><div class="w-full bg-[#b06ab3]"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 py-8"><div class="flex items-center gap-6 max-sm:gap-4"><div aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 w-28 h-28 max-sm:w-20 max-sm:h-20 rounded-2xl bg-[#a665ab] border-4 border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center"><div class="w-16 h-16 max-sm:w-12 max-sm:h-12 rounded-full border-4 border-white"></div></div><div class="flex-1"><h1 class="adt-h3 text-left font-bold text-white" data-id="pg086_n0002">Traditat dhe trash&#xeb;gimia jon&#xeb;</h1><div class="mt-4 inline-block bg-white px-4 py-3 rounded-r-2xl shadow-sm"><h2 class="adt-h2 text-left font-semibold text-gray-900" data-id="pg086_n0004">Veshjet tradicionale</h2></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="mt-3 h-1 w-64 max-sm:w-40 bg-white/80 rounded-full"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 py-10"><div class="mb-6"><h3 class="adt-h3 inline-block text-left font-bold text-gray-900 bg-[#78c47f] px-4 py-2 rounded-md shadow-sm" data-id="pg086_n0006">Situata 1.</h3></div><p class="adt-body text-left text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-4"><span data-id="pg086_n0008">Klea me prind&#xeb;rit kishin vendosur t&#xeb; kalonin nj&#xeb; fundjav&#xeb; n&#xeb; Bjeshk&#xeb;t e Nemuna, n&#xeb; Bog&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg086_n0009">Ai vend aq i bukur me natyr&#xeb; mbres&#xeb;l&#xeb;n&#xeb;se, Kleas i ofronte qet&#xeb;si e k&#xeb;naq&#xeb;si.</span> <span data-id="pg086_n0010">Nd&#xeb;rkoh&#xeb; q&#xeb; po ktheheshin nga pushimi i shkurt&#xeb;r, Klea po u thoshte prind&#xeb;rve q&#xeb; k&#xeb;to male ishin shum&#xeb; t&#xeb; bukura.</span></p><p class="adt-body text-left text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-4"><span data-id="pg086_n0012">N&#xeb;na e Kleas, q&#xeb; &#xe7;monte shum&#xeb; tradit&#xeb;n e popullit ton&#xeb;, shtoi se ky vend, p&#xeb;rve&#xe7;q&#xeb; kishte reliev t&#xeb; mrekulluesh&#xeb;m, kishte dhe shum&#xeb; ve&#xe7;ori t&#xeb; tjera q&#xeb; e b&#xeb;nin kaq t&#xeb; bukur.</span></p><p class="adt-body text-left text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mb-8"><span data-id="pg086_n0014">N&#xeb;na filloi t&#xeb; tregonte p&#xeb;r veshjen tradicionale t&#xeb; Rugov&#xeb;s dhe, nd&#xeb;rkoh&#xeb; q&#xeb; po fliste p&#xeb;r ngjyrat e k&#xeb;saj veshjeje, pun&#xeb;n e dor&#xeb;s e t&#xeb; tjera, Klea mrekullohej dhe vendosi q&#xeb; t&#xeb; k&#xeb;rkonte n&#xeb; internet k&#xeb;to veshje e t&#xeb; b&#xeb;nte nj&#xeb; prezantim p&#xeb;r to para klas&#xeb;s.</span> <span data-id="pg086_n0015">Ajo donte q&#xeb; t&#xeb; nxiste dhe shok&#xeb;t e shoqet e klas&#xeb;s q&#xeb; t&#xeb; njihnin veshjet tradicionale t&#xeb; trevave t&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;s, sepse pothuajse &#xe7;do vend ka veshjen e vet karakteristike.</span></p><figure class="clear-both"><div class="rounded-none border-4 border-[#7dc97f] overflow-hidden shadow-lg bg-white"><img data-id="pg086_im001" src="images/pg086_im001.png" alt="Pamje panoramike e Bjeshk&#xeb;ve e Nemuna n&#xeb; Rugov&#xeb;, me maja t&#xeb; thepisura shk&#xeb;mbore, lugina t&#xeb; thella dhe shpatet me gjelb&#xeb;rim n&#xeb;n qiell t&#xeb; kthjell&#xeb;t." class="w-full h-auto block"></div><figcaption class="adt-caption text-center font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-4" data-id="pg086_n0017">Bjeksh&#xeb;t e Nemuna - Rugov&#xeb;</figcaption></figure></div></section></div>
